# Deny by default. Nothing in this folder is tracked unless it is named below.
#
# Git will not look inside a directory it has been told to ignore, so each
# directory is un-ignored first, its contents are ignored again, and only the
# named files are let back through.

*

!.gitignore
!README.md

!Syllabus/
Syllabus/*
!Syllabus/ECON594-syllabus.pdf

!Lectures/
Lectures/*
!Lectures/00-Course-Setup.pdf
!Lectures/00-Course-Setup.ipynb

!check_setup.py
